```python
def _sentence_span(t, pos):
    left = 0
    for mm in re.finditer(r"[.!?]", t[:pos]):
        left = mm.end()
    right = len(t)
    mm = re.search(r"[.!?]", t[pos:])
    if mm: right = pos + mm.end()
    return t[left:right]
```
